# A property given twice.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (title = "a", title = "b")
---- expected
error[DS5004]: `title` is given twice
  --> query:2:39
  |
2 | | render timechart with (title = "a", title = "b")
  |                          -----        ^^^^^ given again here
  |                          |
  |                          first given here
  |
  = help: remove one of them
